1
00:00:00,855 --> 00:00:02,825
'Cause if she ever found out,
it would hurt her feelings.

2
00:00:02,824 --> 00:00:05,854
(Bernadette:)Emily's feelings?

3
00:00:05,860 --> 00:00:07,830
(Raj:)Yes, Emily.

4
00:00:07,829 --> 00:00:09,559
Nice!
Yay!
Good job!

5
00:00:11,399 --> 00:00:12,999
(Leonard:)Whatever.
Where's Sheldon?

6
00:00:13,001 --> 00:00:14,401
(Amy:)Date night.

7
00:00:14,402 --> 00:00:16,002
Mmm, that can't be
much fun for Amy.

8
00:00:16,004 --> 00:00:18,574
(Leonard:)You know, at work today,
he tried his first Red Bull.

9
00:00:18,573 --> 00:00:19,673
(Bernadette:)What happened?

10
00:00:19,674 --> 00:00:20,844
(Leonard:)He chased a squirrel

11
00:00:20,842 --> 00:00:22,912
(Leonard:)around the quad
for a while and...

12
00:00:24,012 --> 00:00:26,082
(Leonard:)...then threw up in my car.

13
00:00:28,016 --> 00:00:30,186
(Bernadette:)Don't you think you should
make him stop all this?

14
00:00:30,184 --> 00:00:32,754
(Howard:)I don't know-- he's not
really hurting anybody.

15
00:00:32,754 --> 00:00:36,754
(Leonard:)You didn't have to scoop vomit
out of your glove compartment.

16
00:00:36,758 --> 00:00:38,558
(Sheldon:)He is getting
a lot of work done.

17
00:00:38,559 --> 00:00:41,189
(Sheldon:)He had a pretty interesting
take on proton decay.

18
00:00:41,195 --> 00:00:45,035
(Raj:)Wow, if he cracks that,
it's a game changer, guys.

19
00:00:45,033 --> 00:00:47,033
(Raj:)It'll completely redefine
our understanding

20
00:00:47,035 --> 00:00:48,435
(Raj:)of the physical universe.

21
00:00:49,871 --> 00:00:52,401
(Howard:)Hmm, it would.

22
00:00:52,407 --> 00:00:54,807
(Howard:)Okay, back to
"Emily or Cinnamon?"

23
00:00:56,244 --> 00:01:05,024
"How can such a little girl
eat such a big steak?"

